      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "AI-Ark's Export People with Email endpoint refuses a request without an HTTPS webhook; Waterfall Contacts Batch submits every export with this door (plus ?run=<parent execution id>). Answers 200 on receipt, then records the call: the ark pass reads the data table for its track ids instead of polling statistics per export (ruled 2026-09-02)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "@@file:nodes/Record-Callback.js"
      },
      "id": "b7c1d2e3-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Record Callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "PYw0JjF0o7FLmaPw"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "trackId",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.trackId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [],
          "value": {
            "trackId": "={{ $json.trackId }}",
            "state": "={{ $json.state }}",
            "found": "={{ $json.found }}",
            "total": "={{ $json.total }}",
            "run": "={{ $json.run }}",
            "receivedAt": "={{ $json.receivedAt }}",
            "payload": "={{ $json.payload }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b7c1d2e3-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Store Callback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Upsert on trackId, never update-only: a DONE webhook can land before the submitter recorded anything, and the row must exist either way. Data table ai_ark_callbacks (id PYw0JjF0o7FLmaPw; columns trackId string, state string, found number, total number, run string, receivedAt string, payload string), created by the Operator 2026-09-02."
    }
